WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:17.475
Wha-

00:00:18.018 --> 00:00:19.144
What...

00:00:19.978 --> 00:00:21.146
a coincidence!

00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:24.357
Mommy, is it a staring contest?

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:27.986
We both happened...

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:30.363
to be going home after shopping.

00:00:38.413 --> 00:00:40.540
Coincidences like this happen, I guess.

00:00:41.124 --> 00:00:42.500
Last time,

00:00:42.917 --> 00:00:46.046
we promised to fight if we'd meet again.

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:48.798
But maybe not at a place like this.

00:00:49.466 --> 00:00:50.675
It'd be fine with me.

00:00:57.932 --> 00:01:01.561
We can't just part ways now,

00:01:01.853 --> 00:01:05.106
but just starting things here is a bit...

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:06.941
It'd be fine with me.

00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:20.413
Wanna get a drink?

